    "body": "Quick pass: good, with one gap that I name here. The PR merges cleanly with `main`, and the body is complete (`Process change: yes`; `.claude/PROCESS_VERSION` is not changed). The 3 gallery screenshots load.\n\nResults on head `376104a`:\n- `cargo xtask gate batch --only \"debug build: ui\" --only ui`: 32 of 32 steps green (ui-kit and all ui suites).\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui-kit -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo test -p xtask` and clippy of xtask and the gallery feature: clean.\n\nGap: `Cargo.toml` and `Cargo.lock` changed, so `gate quick` selects the full batch plan. The batch steps of the engine crates and of the app test binaries did not run. The diff does not change those crates, and the new crate has no edge to them. The post-merge gate runs the full batch.\n\nThe PR adds a crate edge, changes the workspace and changes `xtask/`. For these reasons the maintainer merges it. I flag it ready for review.\n",
