    "body": "Merged `main`. Ready for a re-check.\n\nMerge commit `40e5d5d` (`origin/main` at `e4b08e9`). Class: DELTA (two conflicts resolved by hand).\n\nResolution:\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/theme.rs`: keeps the re-export seam of this PR. Main added the tokens `close_hover` and `close_ink` (#1120 window chrome). They go into `Tokens` and the `apply_to` destructure of `crates/ui-kit/src/theme.rs`.\n- Git carried the new rows of `tables.rs`, `legal.rs`, `names.rs` and `overlay.rs` into the kit copies.\n- `crates/ui-kit/src/gallery/rows.rs`: the three token listings name the two new tokens.\n- `crates/ui/tests/theme_files/colour_literals.rs`: the list of main, minus the rows of the files that moved to the kit (`contrast.rs`, `theme/tables.rs`).\n- The new test `theme_files/chrome_inks.rs` of main stays in `crates/ui` and reads `Tokens` through the re-export.\n\nGate on `40e5d5d` (mac-1):\n- `cargo xtask gate batch --only \"debug build: ui\" --only ui`: 32 steps, 0 failed, 0 stalled.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui-kit -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: ok.\n- `cargo test -p xtask`: ok.\n\nTest count: 1984 `#[test]` in `crates/ui` on `main`. This head has 1984 in `crates/ui` and 8 in `crates/ui-kit`. The 8 are the own tests of this PR.\n\nThe gallery screenshots are rendered again with the close inks. The PR body has the new gate table, the merge notes and the counts. `main` moved again after `e4b08e9`; `git merge-tree` shows a clean merge with the new `main`.\n",
